# The caps of the wall-clock count gate of scripts/check-waits.sh. The first line that is no comment is `mode warn` or `mode fail`. A cap line is <path><TAB><cap><TAB><reason>.
mode warn
Sources/DirigibleMCP/RideWork.swift	1	The DEBUG hold of interruptWritesNothing waits for the interrupt of the child
Tests/DirigibleCLITests/LevelOverTimeCommandTests.swift	6	interruptWritesNothing waits for the hold line and for the exit of the child
Tests/DirigibleTests/SessionIndexBenchmark.swift	12	A bench reads the clock to time its span and sleeps one 60 Hz frame between events
Tests/DirigibleTests/SessionIndexEditBenchmark.swift	3	A bench reads the clock to time its span and sleeps one 60 Hz frame between events
